### Cleanliness & Sentinel Clearance
- All 6 mutants (`HEAD`, `M1`, `M5`, `M_OPCODE2`, `M_RD15`, `M_NREAD`) were killed by their predicted observables.
- Following mutant runs, `/tmp/gxxscale/src/cpus/cpu_arm_coproc.c` was restored from `GXEMUL-SEC`.
- `cmp -s` confirmed byte-identical match (`CLEAN`) and fresh binary recompilation (`FRESH`).
- `/tmp/gxxscale/.MUTANT` sentinel was removed.
- Confirmation run on restored build reproduced clean `BASE` (26/26).

